o November 4, 2019 (amends original of 10-31-2019; 'Page x of 6'): p7 summary prints balance forward $19,615.32, line 2 $0 (0 contributors), line 3 $3,200.00, line 4 $3,200.00, line 5 expenditures $332.84, line 6 ending balance $22,482.48, footnote 'Actual bank balance is $6,070.01' (in-kind $16,412.47); Attachment A (p8 'See attached' + p9 printout) 4 contribution rows, TOTAL $3,200.00; Attachment B (p10 'See attached' + p11 printout) 4 expenditure rows, TOTAL $332.84. Form-page TOTAL and attached-printout TOTAL are the same schedule figure, listed once each. (3) pp12-14 = start of AMENDED report due October 29, 2019 (amends original of 10-29-2019; 'Page x of 6'): p13 summary prints balance forward $6,869.49, line 2 $456.22 (13 contributors), line 3 $29,620.07, line 4 $30,076.29, line 5 expenditures $17,330.46, line 6 ending balance $19,615.32*, footnote 'Actual bank balance is $3,202.85' (in-kind $16,412.47); p14 is the Attachment A form page ('See Attachment') printing schedule TOTAL $30,076.29, but the itemized contribution rows for that schedule are on the attached printout pages BEYOND p14 -> RANGE ENDS MID-REPORT (the third report's itemized contribution rows and its entire expenditure schedule, total $17,330.46 per summary, are outside this range). cover_totals omitted: no single grand-total cover sheet exists; each report has its own per-period summary sheet (figures given above). Amounts transcribed verbatim (commas and minus sign preserved; leading '$' dropped in row amounts, kept in schedule totals as printed). No illegible spots; all pages are clean typed scans. || Pages 15-28 of 53. Range STARTS MID-FILING: pp.15-17 are attachment pages 4-6 of 6 of a filing whose cover/summary sits in the previous range (contribution schedules dated 09/13/19-10/29/19 with totals 456.22 and 29,620.07; expenditure schedule 09/17/19-10/28/19 with total 17,330.46). p.16 is the Attachment B form ('See Attachment') printing the same TOTAL 17,330.46 as the p.17 attachment - l